	)
	(text "MODE: wait >=20ms after AON_RESET_N high AND >=10ms stable BENCH_LATCHED.\nHold jumper throughout; MODE_LOCK_CLK high 1ms, then never re-sample until AON reset.\nSOURCE lock follows mode lock; requests held >=1ms before/after 1ms pulse.\nWDI: AON-referenced direct MCU falling pulses >=50ns; HIGH >=0.8*VDD.\nENOUT/WDO tied on MCU_NRST_N; future MCU/debug drivers MUST be open drain.\nWDT enable is independent of MCU_NRST_N: no self-disabling feedback."
		(at 175.26 340.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 25 80 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb2b4871-aa08-4da7-ad5f-89068aa3143c")
	)
	(text "Near-rail OD receivers use Schmitt LVC as a CONDITIONAL prototype.\nVT limits are discrete VCC tests: full AON-ramp/edge behavior must be measured.\nWDT_ENABLE load limited to EN + 100k pulldown (<100uA).\nSOURCE_OK, raw presence and main source admission remain future hardware."
		(at 27.94 365.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 25 80 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae0fd7b0-ec08-4e3c-8ab0-b53d6b53bdb0")
	)
